78
00:09:22.171 --> 00:09:23.871
<font color=#0080C0>- <font color=#808080>[KEYS JANGLING]</font>
- All right.</font>

79
00:09:23.873 --> 00:09:25.040
<font color=#0080C0>- Thank you.
- Mmm-hmm.</font>

