97
00:11:36.205 --> 00:11:37.239
<font color=#0080C0>So bright.</font>

98
00:11:38.974 --> 00:11:40.907
<font color=#0080C0>Hey.</font>

99
00:11:40.909 --> 00:11:43.176
<font color=#0080C0>Let's not tell Mommy
you told me, all right?</font>

100
00:11:43.178 --> 00:11:44.911
<font color=#0080C0>- I promise.
- Okay, good.</font>

101
00:11:44.913 --> 00:11:46.614
<font color=#0080C0>Now, come here.
Let me get you to bed.</font>

102
00:11:46.616 --> 00:11:48.382
