104
00:11:49.985 --> 00:11:51.619
<font color=#0080C0>Where'd she go?
Is she hiding on us?</font>

105
00:11:51.621 --> 00:11:53.822
<font color=#0080C0>Where is she?</font>

106
00:11:54.523 --> 00:11:57.459
<font color=#0080C0>Maybe she's in the living room.</font>

