<font color=#0080C0>Okay, Frankie.
Listen to me for a second.</font>

115
00:12:53.549 --> 00:12:55.515
<font color=#0080C0>I need you to go
to sleep for me.</font>

116
00:12:55.517 --> 00:12:57.853
<font color=#0080C0>Right now, okay? Okay.</font>

117
00:13:03.693 --> 00:13:05.829
