122
00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:37.585
<font color=#808080>- [POLICE RADIO BEEPING]
- [CHATTER OVER RADIO]</font>

123
00:14:37.587 --> 00:14:39.219
<font color=#0080C0><font color=#808080>MAN OVER RADIO</font>:
<i>We have a Code 1056</i></font>

124
00:14:39.221 --> 00:14:42.088
<font color=#0080C0><i>at 10622 Magnolia Boulevard.</i></font>

125
00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:44.159
