<font color=#0080C0>Oh, Christ, poor dude.</font>

145
00:16:26.461 --> 00:16:27.795
<font color=#0080C0>Yeah, well...</font>

146
00:16:27.797 --> 00:16:29.364
<font color=#0080C0>Just take care of the body.</font>

