153
00:16:58.795 --> 00:16:59.796
<font color=#0080C0>Oh, yeah?</font>

154
00:17:00.462 --> 00:17:01.731
<font color=#0080C0>Uh, which two?</font>

155
00:17:02.932 --> 00:17:04.801
<font color=#0080C0>They call you
"The Suicide Guy," Jeff.</font>

156
00:17:07.202 --> 00:17:08.303
<font color=#0080C0>What do you want me to say?</font>

157
00:17:09.639 --> 00:17:10.871
<font color=#0080C0>Look.</font>

158
00:17:10.873 --> 00:17:12.572
<font color=#0080C0>All you've been doing
since it happened</font>

159
00:17:12.574 --> 00:17:13.908
<font color=#0080C0>is skulk around
suicide scenes.</font>

160
00:17:13.910 --> 00:17:17.546
<font color=#0080C0>It doesn't make any sense,
and I won't condone it any longer.</font>

161
00:17:18.413 --> 00:17:20.347
<font color=#0080C0>You've gotta get back
in the saddle.</font>

162
00:17:20.349 --> 00:17:22.182
<font color=#0080C0>Let me team you up
with a new partner,</font>

163
00:17:22.184 --> 00:17:24.217
<font color=#0080C0>assign you to a homicide case.</font>

164
00:17:24.219 --> 00:17:26.321
<font color=#0080C0>You have a gift, Jeff.
Don't waste it.</font>

165
00:17:27.289 --> 00:17:29.491
<font color=#0080C0>I am working a homicide case.</font>

166
00:17:30.325 --> 00:17:32.227
<font color=#0080C0>- Elizabeth took her own life.
