171
00:17:41.336 --> 00:17:43.470
<font color=#0080C0>With all the respect
I have for her,</font>

172
00:17:43.472 --> 00:17:45.706
<font color=#0080C0>her work as an artist
was very tormented.</font>

173
00:17:45.708 --> 00:17:47.810
<font color=#0080C0>- We don't know what was going on...
- No, I know!</font>

174
00:17:53.616 --> 00:17:55.317
<font color=#0080C0>She was my wife.</font>

175
00:17:56.385 --> 00:17:58.253
<font color=#0080C0>She was my best friend,
so I know.</font>

176
00:18:01.289 --> 00:18:02.625
<font color=#0080C0>And what about Frankie, hmm?</font>

177
00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:06.259
<font color=#0080C0>I mean, what he said that night,
the nightmare he had.</font>

178
00:18:06.261 --> 00:18:09.396
<font color=#0080C0>A man in his room.
Do you think he made that shit up?</font>

179
00:18:09.398 --> 00:18:11.297
<font color=#0080C0>And the two guys that I saw
on the way in that night.</font>

180
00:18:11.299 --> 00:18:13.000
<font color=#0080C0>I asked everybody
in the fucking building,</font>

181
00:18:13.002 --> 00:18:14.236
<font color=#0080C0>nobody knows who they are.</font>

182
00:18:16.371 --> 00:18:17.607
<font color=#0080C0>This is shady.</font>

183
00:18:18.741 --> 00:18:20.308
<font color=#0080C0>It's not shady...</font>

184
00:18:20.943 --> 00:18:22.377
<font color=#0080C0>it's crazy.</font>

185
00:18:30.419 --> 00:18:31.453
<font color=#0080C0>Okay.</font>

186
00:18:34.423 --> 00:18:37.325
<font color=#808080>[DOOR OPENS AND SHUTS]</font>

187
00:19:45.661 --> 00:19:46.729
