191
00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:10.285
<font color=#0080C0>You got me, buddy.
Come here.</font>

192
00:20:10.953 --> 00:20:12.853
<font color=#0080C0>- Oh...
- I heard the shower</font>

193
00:20:12.855 --> 00:20:15.455
<font color=#0080C0>- and knew it was you.
- Oh, you're always right.</font>

194
00:20:15.457 --> 00:20:16.556
<font color=#0080C0>Can you come play?</font>

195
00:20:16.558 --> 00:20:17.591
<font color=#808080>[LAUGHS]</font>

196
00:20:17.593 --> 00:20:19.894
<font color=#0080C0>Yeah. Let me just talk
to Grandma first, okay?</font>

197
00:20:19.896 --> 00:20:22.930
<font color=#0080C0>- And then we can play.
- Yay!</font>

198
00:20:22.932 --> 00:20:24.332
<font color=#0080C0>I'll be right back, all right?</font>

199
00:20:33.810 --> 00:20:34.811
<font color=#0080C0>Hey, Mom.</font>

200
00:20:36.012 --> 00:20:37.013
<font color=#0080C0>Hi.</font>

201
00:20:40.716 --> 00:20:42.350
<font color=#0080C0>We haven't seen you
in a while.</font>

202
00:20:50.893 --> 00:20:52.494
<font color=#0080C0>At least you took a shower.</font>

203
00:20:55.031 --> 00:20:57.164
<font color=#0080C0>Yeah.</font>

204
00:20:57.166 --> 00:20:59.068
<font color=#0080C0>You're still not going back
to that apartment?</font>

205
00:21:00.169 --> 00:21:01.503
<font color=#0080C0>No, I can't.</font>

206
00:21:02.705 --> 00:21:04.807
<font color=#0080C0>Well, then sell the damn thing
and move on.</font>

207
00:21:07.109 --> 00:21:10.711
<font color=#0080C0>This is a terrible example
for your son!</font>

208
00:21:10.713 --> 00:21:12.913
<font color=#0080C0>You cannot keep coming
back here like this.</font>

209
00:21:12.915 --> 00:21:14.480
<font color=#0080C0>Look, Frankie...</font>

210
00:21:14.482 --> 00:21:16.819
<font color=#0080C0>He's a kid, okay? He doesn't
notice stuff like this.</font>

211
00:21:17.620 --> 00:21:19.019
<font color=#0080C0>Oh, he doesn't?</font>

212
00:21:19.021 --> 00:21:20.921
<font color=#0080C0>That's how little you know
about your son.</font>

213
00:21:20.923 --> 00:21:22.424
<font color=#0080C0>He notices everything!</font>

214
00:21:24.026 --> 00:21:25.491
<font color=#0080C0>And besides...</font>

215
00:21:25.493 --> 00:21:28.095
<font color=#0080C0>- I notice, Jeff.
- Well, you're my mother.</font>

216
00:21:28.097 --> 00:21:30.496
<font color=#0080C0>And you understand
what I'm going through, right?</font>

217
00:21:30.498 --> 00:21:32.600
<font color=#0080C0>Two months ago, I understood.</font>

218
00:21:32.602 --> 00:21:34.935
<font color=#0080C0>Now it is just self-destruction.</font>

219
00:21:34.937 --> 00:21:36.538
<font color=#0080C0>I need one thing
from you, Mom.</font>

220
00:21:37.907 --> 00:21:39.141
<font color=#0080C0>Be there for Frankie.</font>

221
00:21:40.209 --> 00:21:41.677
<font color=#0080C0>I can't be, not yet.</font>

222
00:21:43.045 --> 00:21:45.447
<font color=#0080C0>You won't bring her back
by killing yourself.</font>

223
00:21:48.951 --> 00:21:50.084
<font color=#0080C0>There.</font>

224
00:21:50.086 --> 00:21:51.153
<font color=#0080C0>I said it.</font>

225
00:21:53.656 --> 00:21:55.390
<font color=#0080C0>Yeah. You said it.</font>

226
00:22:33.930 --> 00:22:35.164
<font color=#0080C0>Are you okay, Dad?</font>

227
00:22:36.899 --> 00:22:37.900
<font color=#0080C0>Yeah, buddy.</font>

228
00:22:38.267 --> 00:22:39.501
<font color=#0080C0>I'm good.</font>

229
00:22:40.236 --> 00:22:41.436
<font color=#808080>[SNIFFLES]</font>

230
00:22:49.879 --> 00:22:51.113
<font color=#0080C0>I love you.
You know that, right?</font>

231
00:22:51.681 --> 00:22:53.448
<font color=#0080C0>Give me a hug. Come on.</font>

232
00:22:53.816 --> 00:22:54.817
<font color=#0080C0>Yeah.</font>

233
00:22:55.918 --> 00:22:57.219
<font color=#0080C0>I gotta go, okay?</font>

234
00:23:21.010 --> 00:23:22.477
<font color=#808080>[CELL PHONE RINGING]</font>

235
00:23:28.284 --> 00:23:31.618
<font color=#0080C0>- Anderson.
- <i>Jeff, it's Capt... It's Kelly.</i></font>

236
00:23:31.620 --> 00:23:32.855
<font color=#0080C0><i>You gotta get to the hospital.</i></font>

237
00:23:33.289 --> 00:23:34.489
<font color=#0080C0><i>Now.</i></font>

238
00:23:35.725 --> 00:23:37.157
<font color=#0080C0>Kelly, what's going on?</font>

239
00:23:37.159 --> 00:23:39.061
<font color=#0080C0><i>Get moving. I'll brief you
on the way.</i></font>

240
00:23:42.898 --> 00:23:44.734
<font color=#808080>[CAR ENGINE STARTS]</font>

241
00:24:36.986 --> 00:24:37.987
<font color=#0080C0>Miss Wilson?</font>

242
00:24:41.057 --> 00:24:43.125
<font color=#0080C0>I'm Detective
Jeff Anderson, LAPD.</font>

243
00:24:45.761 --> 00:24:47.694
<font color=#0080C0>I know you're going
through something...</font>

244
00:24:47.696 --> 00:24:48.931
<font color=#0080C0>unimaginable right now.</font>

245
00:24:50.032 --> 00:24:53.667
<font color=#0080C0>I already, uh, told everything
to your colleagues.</font>

246
00:24:53.669 --> 00:24:56.138
<font color=#0080C0>But I need to hear firsthand
what happened to you.</font>

247
00:24:57.339 --> 00:24:58.607
<font color=#0080C0>In your own words.</font>

248
00:25:03.813 --> 00:25:05.915
<font color=#0080C0>Um, my boyfriend, Mike,</font>

249
00:25:06.782 --> 00:25:08.984
<font color=#0080C0>had left to go home.</font>

250
00:25:10.786 --> 00:25:13.923
<font color=#0080C0>I heard the
apartment door, and...</font>

251
00:25:15.257 --> 00:25:16.859
<font color=#0080C0>I thought maybe it was him.</font>

252
00:25:17.460 --> 00:25:19.128
<font color=#0080C0>Maybe he forgot something.</font>

253
00:25:23.732 --> 00:25:25.201
<font color=#0080C0>But then, two guys...</font>

254
00:25:26.268 --> 00:25:27.336
<font color=#0080C0>came in...</font>

255
00:25:28.737 --> 00:25:29.738
<font color=#0080C0>Um...</font>

256
00:25:31.407 --> 00:25:32.942
<font color=#0080C0>The older one's...</font>

257
00:25:33.442 --> 00:25:34.977
<font color=#0080C0>in his 60s.</font>

258
00:25:36.679 --> 00:25:37.713
<font color=#0080C0>And...</font>

259
00:25:40.883 --> 00:25:43.085
<font color=#0080C0>He looked like
he hated my guts.</font>

260
00:25:48.190 --> 00:25:51.193
<font color=#0080C0>The younger guy
was in his 20s...</font>

261
00:25:51.627 --> 00:25:53.062
<font color=#0080C0>and he had a gun.</font>

262
00:25:56.332 --> 00:25:57.333
<font color=#0080C0>Um...</font>

263
00:25:58.234 --> 00:25:59.335
<font color=#0080C0>Older guy...</font>

264
00:26:01.437 --> 00:26:04.006
<font color=#0080C0>handed me a bottle
of sleeping pills.</font>

265
00:26:06.775 --> 00:26:07.810
<font color=#0080C0>And...</font>

266
00:26:09.478 --> 00:26:10.679
<font color=#0080C0>He, uh...</font>

267
00:26:11.914 --> 00:26:12.948
<font color=#0080C0>told me, uh...</font>

268
00:26:14.750 --> 00:26:15.784
<font color=#0080C0>"Take them."</font>

269
00:26:17.419 --> 00:26:19.355
<font color=#0080C0>'Cause he knew where
my mother lived.</font>

270
00:26:31.400 --> 00:26:32.434
<font color=#0080C0>And then...</font>

271
00:26:34.403 --> 00:26:36.138
<font color=#0080C0>Mike did forget something.</font>

272
00:26:43.979 --> 00:26:45.746
<font color=#0080C0>And then, uh,</font>

273
00:26:45.748 --> 00:26:47.082
<font color=#0080C0>the next thing I remember is...</font>

274
00:26:47.683 --> 00:26:49.118
<font color=#0080C0>waking up in this room.</font>

275
00:26:53.956 --> 00:26:55.024
<font color=#0080C0>Where is Mike?</font>

276
00:26:57.193 --> 00:26:58.194
<font color=#0080C0>Um...</font>

277
00:26:59.328 --> 00:27:01.795
<font color=#0080C0>- This wasn't...
- I'm Jane.</font>

278
00:27:01.797 --> 00:27:03.232
<font color=#0080C0>So, call... Call me Jane.</font>

279
00:27:03.799 --> 00:27:04.800
<font color=#0080C0>Jane...</font>

280
00:27:07.503 --> 00:27:08.704
<font color=#0080C0>No.</font>

281
00:27:10.306 --> 00:27:13.774
<font color=#0080C0>No, don't say it. Don't.</font>

282
00:27:13.776 --> 00:27:15.444
<font color=#0080C0>- Don't say it.
- They shot him.</font>

283
00:27:19.114 --> 00:27:21.083
<font color=#0080C0>- He didn't make it.
- <font color=#808080>[CRYING]</font></font>

284
00:27:26.355 --> 00:27:27.356
<font color=#0080C0>I'm sorry.</font>

285
00:27:36.332 --> 00:27:38.033
<font color=#808080>[CONTINUES CRYING]</font>

286
00:27:51.113 --> 00:27:53.148
<font color=#808080>[DOOR OPENS]</font>

287
00:27:54.016 --> 00:27:55.082
<font color=#0080C0>- Jeff...
- No.</font>

288
00:27:55.084 --> 00:27:56.483
<font color=#0080C0>I don't know what
to say. This is...</font>

289
00:27:56.485 --> 00:27:58.420
<font color=#0080C0>No, this is exactly what I've been
saying for the last six months!</font>

290
00:28:03.392 --> 00:28:05.058
<font color=#0080C0>Look...</font>

291
00:28:05.060 --> 00:28:08.063
<font color=#0080C0>You understand
what I have to do, right?</font>

292
00:28:09.265 --> 00:28:10.499
<font color=#0080C0>I do.</font>

293
00:28:25.881 --> 00:28:27.516
<font color=#0080C0>- Where's it at?
- Upstairs.</font>

294
00:29:00.617 --> 00:29:01.817
<font color=#0080C0>They started here...</font>

295
00:29:03.085 --> 00:29:04.219
<font color=#0080C0>and there.</font>

296
00:29:05.120 --> 00:29:06.288
<font color=#808080>[SIGHS]</font>

297
00:32:13.375 --> 00:32:14.611
<font color=#808080>[EXHALES DEEPLY]</font>

298
00:32:17.312 --> 00:32:19.147
<font color=#808080>[PRINTER WHIRRING]</font>

299
00:33:28.317 --> 00:33:30.185
<font color=#808080>[CELL PHONE RINGING]</font>

300
00:33:31.553 --> 00:33:33.253
<font color=#0080C0>- Yeah.
- <font color=#808080>FRANKIE</font>: <i>Daddy?</i></font>

301
00:33:33.255 --> 00:33:35.723
<font color=#0080C0>Frankie, hey. <font color=#808080>[CHUCKLES]</font></font>

302
00:33:35.725 --> 00:33:38.291
<font color=#0080C0>Hey, buddy. What're you doing?
Is Grandma with you?</font>

303
00:33:38.293 --> 00:33:41.328
<font color=#0080C0><i>Are we still going
to Disneyland?</i></font>

304
00:33:41.330 --> 00:33:42.630
<font color=#0080C0>No, buddy. I'm sorry.</font>

305
00:33:42.632 --> 00:33:44.665
<font color=#0080C0>I totally forgot about that.</font>

306
00:33:44.667 --> 00:33:45.800
<font color=#0080C0><i>Can we go tomorrow?</i></font>

307
00:33:45.802 --> 00:33:48.636
<font color=#0080C0>No, no, no, no. Daddy's got
a lot of work right now.</font>

308
00:33:48.638 --> 00:33:50.740
<font color=#0080C0>Are you looking for a bad guy?</font>

309
00:33:51.808 --> 00:33:53.674
<font color=#0080C0>Two of 'em, actually.</font>

310
00:33:53.676 --> 00:33:55.444
<font color=#0080C0><i>What did they do?</i></font>

311
00:33:57.780 --> 00:33:59.580
<font color=#0080C0>They did some bad things.</font>

312
00:33:59.582 --> 00:34:00.948
<font color=#0080C0>Did they kill Mom?</font>

313
00:34:00.950 --> 00:34:02.184
<font color=#0080C0><font color=#808080>GRANDMA</font>: Frankie.</font>

314
00:34:02.885 --> 00:34:04.184
<font color=#0080C0><i>Let Granny have the phone.</i></font>

315
00:34:04.186 --> 00:34:07.657
<font color=#0080C0>I'll talk to Daddy for a minute
and you just go inside, okay?</font>

316
00:34:08.357 --> 00:34:09.491
<font color=#0080C0>Good boy.</font>

317
00:34:13.863 --> 00:34:15.328
<font color=#0080C0>Are you crazy?</font>

318
00:34:15.330 --> 00:34:16.797
<font color=#0080C0><i>Talking about this
with your son?</i></font>

319
00:34:16.799 --> 00:34:18.565
<font color=#0080C0>Mom, hey.</font>

320
00:34:18.567 --> 00:34:21.534
<font color=#0080C0>Look, I didn't check
my caller ID, he surprised me.</font>

321
00:34:21.536 --> 00:34:24.504
<font color=#0080C0>Frankie has been looking forward
to going to Disneyland</font>

322
00:34:24.506 --> 00:34:26.539
<font color=#0080C0>with you today for weeks.</font>

323
00:34:26.541 --> 00:34:27.942
<font color=#0080C0><i>You promised him, Jeff!</i></font>

324
00:34:27.944 --> 00:34:29.777
<font color=#0080C0>Yeah, I know. Mom, Mom, look.</font>

325
00:34:29.779 --> 00:34:31.511
<font color=#0080C0>I'll make it up to him,
I promise.</font>

326
00:34:31.513 --> 00:34:32.847
<font color=#0080C0><i>That's not how
little boys think.</i></font>

327
00:34:32.849 --> 00:34:35.548
<font color=#0080C0>They need a father
who they can trust</font>

328
00:34:35.550 --> 00:34:36.617
<font color=#0080C0>and who they can depend on,</font>

329
00:34:36.619 --> 00:34:38.588
<font color=#0080C0>not one that makes
empty promises.</font>

330
00:34:39.889 --> 00:34:41.189
<font color=#0080C0>I got to go, Mom.</font>

331
00:34:49.866 --> 00:34:51.266
<font color=#0080C0>I miss you.</font>

332
00:35:00.877 --> 00:35:02.475
<font color=#0080C0>- What have you got?
- I have a theory.</font>

333
00:35:02.477 --> 00:35:03.543
<font color=#0080C0>You always do.</font>

334
00:35:03.545 --> 00:35:06.246
<font color=#0080C0>I found 19 prominent women
who committed suicide</font>

335
00:35:06.248 --> 00:35:08.381
<font color=#0080C0>by slashing their wrists
in their bathtubs,</font>

336
00:35:08.383 --> 00:35:10.550
<font color=#0080C0>after ingesting sleeping pills.</font>

337
00:35:10.552 --> 00:35:11.854
<font color=#0080C0>All of them
in the Los Angeles area.</font>

338
00:35:12.822 --> 00:35:14.791
<font color=#0080C0>And I only went back 10 years.</font>

339
00:35:16.626 --> 00:35:17.827
<font color=#0080C0>Guys, give me a second.</font>

340
00:35:19.428 --> 00:35:20.861
<font color=#0080C0>What do you mean
by "prominent women"?</font>

341
00:35:20.863 --> 00:35:24.497
<font color=#0080C0>Doctors, lawyers, artists,
politicians, you name it.</font>

342
00:35:24.499 --> 00:35:27.267
<font color=#0080C0>Now, these women were featured
prominently in the news</font>

343
00:35:27.269 --> 00:35:28.905
<font color=#0080C0>in the weeks preceding
their suicides.</font>

344
00:35:30.807 --> 00:35:32.907
<font color=#0080C0>Are you saying all these women
were murdered by our two suspects?</font>

345
00:35:32.909 --> 00:35:34.041
<font color=#0080C0>Probably not all of them.</font>

346
00:35:34.043 --> 00:35:36.476
<font color=#0080C0>- Okay, which ones then?
- How the fuck should I know?</font>

347
00:35:36.478 --> 00:35:38.779
<font color=#0080C0>I mean, there's no crime scene,
there's no evidence, nothing.</font>

348
00:35:38.781 --> 00:35:40.515
<font color=#0080C0>These guys are pros.</font>

349
00:35:41.651 --> 00:35:43.416
<font color=#0080C0>That's your theory?</font>

350
00:35:43.418 --> 00:35:46.687
<font color=#0080C0>Two men are simulating
women suicides on a large scale.</font>

351
00:35:46.689 --> 00:35:48.555
<font color=#0080C0>Prominent women.</font>

352
00:35:48.557 --> 00:35:50.490
<font color=#0080C0>If your theory's correct,
how come no one's ever noticed?</font>

353
00:35:50.492 --> 00:35:51.992
<font color=#0080C0>Kelly, I noticed...</font>

354
00:35:51.994 --> 00:35:54.795
<font color=#0080C0>and nobody believed me,
but I understand that.</font>

355
00:35:54.797 --> 00:35:56.097
<font color=#0080C0>There's no apparent motives.</font>

356
00:35:56.099 --> 00:35:59.532
<font color=#0080C0>There's no clues. These are not
even identified as murders.</font>

357
00:35:59.534 --> 00:36:02.939
<font color=#0080C0>And there are over a thousand
suicides a year in this fucking town.</font>

358
00:36:03.840 --> 00:36:06.607
<font color=#0080C0>So these are perfect crimes?</font>

359
00:36:06.609 --> 00:36:07.877
<font color=#0080C0>As close as they get.</font>

360
00:36:09.712 --> 00:36:10.845
<font color=#0080C0>What's their motive?</font>

361
00:36:10.847 --> 00:36:13.248
<font color=#0080C0>I don't know yet.
But they hate women,</font>

362
00:36:14.584 --> 00:36:15.752
<font color=#0080C0>that's for sure.</font>

363
00:36:17.620 --> 00:36:18.686
<font color=#808080>[SIGHS]</font>

364
00:36:18.688 --> 00:36:20.386
<font color=#0080C0>Look, I need a team, Kelly.</font>

365
00:36:20.388 --> 00:36:22.957
<font color=#0080C0>There's way too much information
to process, I need help.</font>

366
00:36:22.959 --> 00:36:25.092
<font color=#0080C0>Jeff, I can't do
that sort of thing anymore.</font>

367
00:36:25.094 --> 00:36:28.929
<font color=#0080C0>It's not just you and me
in a car in stakeout mode.</font>

368
00:36:28.931 --> 00:36:30.465
<font color=#0080C0>Okay. Right.</font>

369
00:36:54.924 --> 00:36:59.695
<font color=#808080>[MUTTERING INDISTINCTLY]</font>

370
00:37:09.404 --> 00:37:10.840
<font color=#0080C0>I hate you.</font>

371
00:37:15.678 --> 00:37:17.747
<font color=#0080C0>I hate you.</font>

372
00:37:24.486 --> 00:37:26.887
<font color=#0080C0>I hate you!</font>

373
00:37:26.889 --> 00:37:28.791
<font color=#808080>[BREATHING HEAVILY]</font>

374
00:39:20.803 --> 00:39:22.069
<font color=#0080C0>I came as soon as I could.</font>

375
00:39:22.071 --> 00:39:23.438
<font color=#0080C0>Thanks. Come in.</font>

376
00:39:35.685 --> 00:39:36.786
<font color=#0080C0>My God, Jeff.</font>

377
00:39:37.386 --> 00:39:38.652
<font color=#0080C0>What have you been doing?</font>

378
00:39:38.654 --> 00:39:40.788
<font color=#0080C0>I tried to think like they do,</font>

379
00:39:40.790 --> 00:39:42.692
<font color=#0080C0>and now I know
how they operate.</font>

380
00:40:10.820 --> 00:40:12.820
<font color=#0080C0>And then they're gone.</font>

381
00:40:12.822 --> 00:40:13.889
<font color=#0080C0>Just like that.</font>

382
00:40:15.291 --> 00:40:17.091
<font color=#0080C0>Okay.</font>

383
00:40:17.093 --> 00:40:19.760
<font color=#0080C0>Let's just say
your theory is accurate.</font>

384
00:40:19.762 --> 00:40:20.828
<font color=#0080C0>Mmm-hmm.</font>

385
00:40:20.830 --> 00:40:22.162
<font color=#0080C0>What do we do about it?</font>

386
00:40:22.164 --> 00:40:24.031
<font color=#0080C0>Okay, look, I made a list</font>

387
00:40:24.033 --> 00:40:26.168
<font color=#0080C0>of the women that I would
kill next if I was them.</font>

388
00:40:27.336 --> 00:40:29.937
<font color=#0080C0>- How'd you do all this?
- I told you. Look at this shit!</font>

389
00:40:29.939 --> 00:40:31.772
<font color=#0080C0>- Are you kidding me?
- Jeff.</font>

390
00:40:31.774 --> 00:40:33.040
<font color=#0080C0>For two weeks,
I've been doing this.</font>

391
00:40:33.042 --> 00:40:34.608
<font color=#0080C0>Jeff, you are scaring me.</font>

392
00:40:34.610 --> 00:40:35.876
<font color=#0080C0>Look, it's fine. It's okay.</font>

393
00:40:35.878 --> 00:40:38.612
<font color=#0080C0>But these women need to be put
into protective custody today.</font>

