01:08:07.229 --> 01:08:08.497
<font color=#0080C0>Do you believe me now?</font>

780
01:08:17.607 --> 01:08:18.808
<font color=#0080C0>Good boy.</font>

781
01:09:08.925 --> 01:09:10.660
<font color=#808080>[CELL PHONE RINGING]</font>

782
01:09:15.765 --> 01:09:17.564
<font color=#0080C0>What now?</font>

783
01:09:17.566 --> 01:09:19.767
<font color=#0080C0>I'm gonna text you an address, you're gonna
come right away and you're gonna bring my son.</font>

784
01:09:19.769 --> 01:09:21.570
<font color=#0080C0>You know what, you're
getting ahead of yourself.</font>

785
01:09:25.474 --> 01:09:26.676
<font color=#0080C0>You're a cop.</font>

786
01:09:27.342 --> 01:09:30.477
<font color=#808080>[GRUNTS]</font>

787
01:09:30.479 --> 01:09:33.748
<font color=#0080C0>You killed my wife, and my partner.
You took my son.</font>

788
01:09:33.750 --> 01:09:37.417
<font color=#0080C0><font color=#808080>[SHOUTS]</font> Do you think I give a fuck,
a single fuck, about being a cop?</font>

789
01:09:37.419 --> 01:09:39.319
<font color=#0080C0>Dad, Dad, what do you
want me to do here?</font>

790
01:09:39.321 --> 01:09:40.955
<font color=#0080C0>No matter how many times
you hit me,</font>

791
01:09:40.957 --> 01:09:42.757
<font color=#0080C0>you're never gonna get us to do</font>

792
01:09:42.759 --> 01:09:44.627
<font color=#0080C0>anything we don't wanna do.</font>

793
01:09:46.028 --> 01:09:47.429
<font color=#0080C0>Really?</font>

794
01:09:48.865 --> 01:09:50.664
<font color=#0080C0>Okay. You asked for it.</font>

795
01:09:50.666 --> 01:09:51.667
<font color=#0080C0>No!</font>

796
01:09:52.101 --> 01:09:53.901
<font color=#0080C0>Dad! Dad!</font>

797
01:09:53.903 --> 01:09:55.803
<font color=#0080C0>I'm gonna text you an address,</font>

798
01:09:55.805 --> 01:09:58.505
<font color=#0080C0>and you're gonna be here
in an hour.</font>

799
01:09:58.507 --> 01:10:02.444
<font color=#0080C0>Jesus fucking Christ!
Jesus fucking Christ!</font>

800
01:10:06.048 --> 01:10:07.581
<font color=#808080>[GROANING]</font>

801
01:10:07.583 --> 01:10:08.584
<font color=#0080C0>That looks like
it kinda hurts.</font>

802
01:10:20.930 --> 01:10:22.531
<font color=#808080>[MESSAGE ALERT BEEPS]</font>

803
01:10:34.476 --> 01:10:35.912
<font color=#808080>[MARK GROANING]</font>

804
01:10:37.680 --> 01:10:40.683
<font color=#0080C0>Doesn't it strike you
that you and I are a lot alike?</font>

805
01:10:42.952 --> 01:10:45.152
<font color=#0080C0>I think you're losing
blood to the brain.</font>

806
01:10:45.154 --> 01:10:47.520
<font color=#0080C0>I killed your wife,
tore your life apart,</font>

807
01:10:47.522 --> 01:10:50.390
<font color=#0080C0>you became obsessed and started
living by that obsession.</font>

808
01:10:50.392 --> 01:10:51.661
<font color=#0080C0>I made you, Jeff.</font>

809
01:10:53.896 --> 01:10:58.132
<font color=#0080C0>Just like the women
in my life made me.</font>

810
01:10:58.134 --> 01:11:00.567
<font color=#0080C0>You're not gonna make it out of here alive.
I want you to know that.</font>

811
01:11:00.569 --> 01:11:03.403
<font color=#0080C0>Let's see what Adam
has to say about that.</font>

812
01:11:03.405 --> 01:11:04.974
<font color=#0080C0>Aren't you ashamed
of what you made him?</font>

813
01:11:06.008 --> 01:11:08.008
<font color=#0080C0>I'm very proud of him.</font>

814
01:11:08.010 --> 01:11:09.879
<font color=#0080C0>Never forget,
he grew up without a mother.</font>

815
01:11:30.766 --> 01:11:32.733
<font color=#808080>[ADAM SIGHS]</font>

816
01:11:32.735 --> 01:11:34.101
<font color=#0080C0>Where's Frankie?</font>

817
01:11:34.103 --> 01:11:35.137
<font color=#0080C0>You okay, Dad?</font>

818
01:11:36.504 --> 01:11:38.038
<font color=#0080C0>I'll live.</font>

819
01:11:38.040 --> 01:11:40.140
<font color=#0080C0>I wanna see my son, now.</font>

820
01:11:40.142 --> 01:11:42.209
<font color=#0080C0>You release my father,
and I release Frankie,</font>

821
01:11:42.211 --> 01:11:43.611
<font color=#0080C0>it's as simple as that.</font>

822
01:11:43.613 --> 01:11:44.680
<font color=#0080C0>Now!</font>

823
01:11:46.148 --> 01:11:49.683
<font color=#0080C0>By the way, we became
good friends, Frankie and I.</font>

824
01:11:49.685 --> 01:11:51.819
<font color=#0080C0>We got a lot in common.</font>

825
01:11:51.821 --> 01:11:52.953
<font color=#0080C0>Don't you think I know
what you're doing?</font>

826
01:11:52.955 --> 01:11:54.624
<font color=#0080C0>I don't buy your
bullshit mind games.</font>

827
01:11:56.558 --> 01:11:57.927
<font color=#0080C0>Get out of here, Adam.</font>

828
01:11:59.996 --> 01:12:02.029
<font color=#0080C0>Let me tell you
what happens next.</font>

829
01:12:02.031 --> 01:12:05.699
<font color=#0080C0>We part ways,
Adam keeps Frankie...</font>

830
01:12:05.701 --> 01:12:08.969
<font color=#0080C0>you bring me before a jury and
you let my lawyer go through</font>

831
01:12:08.971 --> 01:12:11.138
<font color=#0080C0>all the irregularities
of my arrest.</font>

832
01:12:11.140 --> 01:12:14.608
<font color=#0080C0>I take my chances with the
judge, and you lose your job.</font>

833
01:12:14.610 --> 01:12:20.480
<font color=#0080C0>In the meantime, Frankie gets to spend
some quality time with Uncle Adam.</font>

834
01:12:20.482 --> 01:12:22.016
<font color=#0080C0>He'll make
an excellent apprentice.</font>

835
01:12:22.018 --> 01:12:24.820
<font color=#0080C0>He has the best
possible background.</font>

836
01:12:26.889 --> 01:12:29.522
<font color=#0080C0>No! Stop!</font>

837
01:12:29.524 --> 01:12:33.029
<font color=#0080C0>I'm gonna keep counting, and each time
I reach three, he loses another limb!</font>

838
01:12:33.729 --> 01:12:34.797
<font color=#0080C0>One!</font>

839
01:12:35.530 --> 01:12:36.699
<font color=#0080C0>Two!</font>

840
01:12:38.067 --> 01:12:39.967
<font color=#0080C0>Three!</font>

841
01:12:39.969 --> 01:12:41.869
<font color=#0080C0>Wait, wait, wait! Wait.</font>

842
01:12:41.871 --> 01:12:43.139
<font color=#808080>[MARK GROANS]</font>

843
01:12:46.142 --> 01:12:48.010
<font color=#0080C0>You just killed your own son.</font>

844
01:13:00.823 --> 01:13:02.723
<font color=#0080C0>Dad! No!</font>

845
01:13:02.725 --> 01:13:04.792
<font color=#0080C0>Dad! You motherfucker,
he was everything to me!</font>

846
01:13:04.794 --> 01:13:06.862
<font color=#0080C0>Tell me! Where's Frankie?</font>

847
01:13:09.165 --> 01:13:12.168
<font color=#0080C0>So you got nothing left to exchange,
and I got nothing to fucking lose!</font>

848
01:13:13.803 --> 01:13:15.535
<font color=#0080C0>I guess that makes us dead men.</font>

849
01:13:15.537 --> 01:13:18.040
<font color=#0080C0>Daddy! Please help me!</font>

850
01:13:18.341 --> 01:13:19.541
<font color=#808080>[GUNSHOT]</font>

851
01:13:22.945 --> 01:13:24.578
<font color=#808080>[BOTH GRUNTING]</font>

852
01:13:24.580 --> 01:13:26.048
<font color=#0080C0><font color=#808080>FRANKIE</font>: Help me!</font>

853
01:13:53.075 --> 01:13:54.677
<font color=#0080C0>Help me!</font>

854
01:14:21.904 --> 01:14:26.175
<font color=#0080C0><font color=#808080>[DISTORTED]</font> Fuck you! Fuck you!</font>

855
01:14:59.975 --> 01:15:01.043
<font color=#0080C0>Why?</font>

856
01:15:02.912 --> 01:15:04.647
<font color=#0080C0>Why did you help him
kill all those women?</font>

857
01:15:06.649 --> 01:15:08.651
<font color=#0080C0>My father raised me that way.</font>

858
01:15:12.054 --> 01:15:13.689
<font color=#0080C0>So go ahead, do it.</font>

859
01:15:14.924 --> 01:15:15.991
<font color=#0080C0>Do it!</font>

860
01:15:26.202 --> 01:15:27.269
<font color=#0080C0>Daddy?</font>

861
01:15:28.337 --> 01:15:30.270
<font color=#0080C0><font color=#808080>ADAM</font>: Do it!</font>

862
01:15:30.272 --> 01:15:34.376
<font color=#0080C0>- What are... What are you doing?
- Frankie! Frankie, come here!</font>

863
01:15:36.045 --> 01:15:37.778
<font color=#0080C0>Okay. All right.</font>

864
01:15:37.780 --> 01:15:38.948
<font color=#0080C0>It's over. It's over.</font>

865
01:15:39.315 --> 01:15:41.350
<font color=#0080C0>Okay? Okay.</font>

866
01:15:43.319 --> 01:15:44.918
<font color=#0080C0>It's okay, buddy.</font>

867
01:15:44.920 --> 01:15:46.787
<font color=#0080C0>I'm gonna put you
in the car, okay?</font>

868
01:15:46.789 --> 01:15:48.922
<font color=#0080C0>I just need you to
go in the car.</font>

869
01:15:48.924 --> 01:15:52.259
<font color=#0080C0>All right? And put
your seatbelt on for me. Okay?</font>

870
01:15:52.261 --> 01:15:54.695
<font color=#0080C0>Yeah, good boy.
Good boy.</font>

871
01:15:54.697 --> 01:15:56.332
<font color=#0080C0>Just put that on.
All right?</font>

872
01:16:05.474 --> 01:16:06.942
<font color=#0080C0>I'll be right back.</font>

873
01:16:08.244 --> 01:16:09.745
<font color=#0080C0>Get up. Get up!</font>

874
01:16:10.279 --> 01:16:11.847
<font color=#808080>[MUMBLES INDISTINCTLY]</font>

875
01:16:12.248 --> 01:16:13.649
<font color=#0080C0>Move. Move!</font>

876
01:16:16.352 --> 01:16:18.821
<font color=#808080>[HANDCUFFS CLICKING]</font>

877
01:16:21.090 --> 01:16:23.190
<font color=#0080C0>Your father was everything
to you.</font>

878
01:16:23.192 --> 01:16:25.159
<font color=#0080C0>Let's see how you manage
without him.</font>

879
01:16:25.161 --> 01:16:26.896
<font color=#808080>[ADAM COUGHING]</font>

880
01:16:45.915 --> 01:16:47.917
<font color=#0080C0>Why are you throwing it away?</font>

881
01:16:50.085 --> 01:16:51.987
<font color=#0080C0>I'm done with it, buddy,
I don't need it anymore.</font>

882
01:16:57.326 --> 01:16:58.694
<font color=#0080C0>Hey, Frankie,
where are you going?</font>

883
01:17:15.244 --> 01:17:18.078
<font color=#0080C0>You catch bad guys, Dad.
That's your job.</font>

884
01:17:18.080 --> 01:17:19.782
<font color=#0080C0>People need you.</font>

885
01:17:30.159 --> 01:17:31.460
<font color=#0080C0>Close the door.</font>

886
01:17:33.229 --> 01:17:34.294
<font color=#0080C0>Put your seatbelt on.</font>

887
01:17:34.296 --> 01:17:35.297
<font color=#808080>[SNIFFLES]</font>

888
01:17:40.469 --> 01:17:41.737
<font color=#0080C0>You ready?</font>

889
01:17:42.905 --> 01:17:44.171
<font color=#0080C0>Let's go.</font>

890
01:17:44.173 --> 01:17:45.207
<font color=#808080>[CAR STARTING]</font>

891
01:18:00.389 --> 01:18:02.825
<font color=#0080C0><font color=#808080>[SHOUTS]</font> What, are you just
gonna leave me here?</font>

892
01:18:35.491 --> 01:18:36.992
<font color=#0080C0>I love you.</font>

893
01:18:37.192 --> 01:18:44.192
<u><b><font color=#FF0080>Subtitle By: <font color=#FF8040>MARSH-MARIE</font></font></b></u>

894
01:19:04.153 --> 01:19:06.088
<font color=#808080>[SIRENS WAILING]</font>
